     **The[0m[2m fix:**
     1[0m[2m. Need[0m[2m to[0m[2m make inventory[0m[2m reservation atomic[0m[2m.[0m[2m The[0m[2m key[0m[2m insight is that[0m[2m stock[0m[2m check and decrement must[0m[2m be[0m[2m atomic —[0m[2m we[0m[2m should[0m[2m use[0m[2m a single[0m[2m operation that reserves[0m[2m stock[0m[2m,[0m[2m and[0m[2m only[0m[2m proceed[0m[2m to[0m[2m charge[0m[2m if reservation[0m[2m succeeds.
